From 8b47de1f4279a53bdb195c422b4c8244347fddb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 15:03:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/14] [tests/gtest]: implement RIB table NLRI assertions in
 test body

Ensures the expected RIB table matches the BGP-LS RIB table after test
execution. Development of `linkstate_data.h` is necessary for
replicating the structure of BGP-LS NLRI primitives used within FRR.
Attempting to include specific C headers from bgpd results in a cascade
of errors caused by different issues related to integrating legacy C
code with C++.

Signed-off-by: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
